ly I\'m using realme wireless buds, both are best in this segment but OnePlus is more battery life n extra multiple device connectivity button n latest design...\n\nGood product. Never used bluetooth headset before. Now I am happy to see ease in my work. As I noticed boat marketing their products aggressively in market in recent days. About product it\'s like awesome having better build quality, bass is good, battery backup is fine and vibration though it vibrates my neck when ever I gets call but still feature is must needed when u are driving. Wanted to give 5star but there is a sentence that " Nothing is perfect in this imperfect world" \U0001f604\U0001f604\U0001f609'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'name all theheadphones names'}], 'model': 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 'n': 1, 'reasoning_effort': None, 'reasoning_format': None, 'service_tier': 'on_demand', 'stop': None, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 1e-08}}
